	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Libellos te accepisse de morte <persName ref="p19981">Pauli</persName> papae <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>dubito minime.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">En admirandam rem fictitius noster prępositus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>summi templi d. a. <persName>Gumpenberg</persName>, curtisanorum omnium coriphęus, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad nos 29. decembris venit stipatus magna caterva sericatorum doctorum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et servorum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Venereas puellas tam molliter nunquam credo fuisse indutas, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut Christus non frustra dicat: "In regum aulis inveniuntur, qui <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mollia gestant."</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Adfuit doctor <persName ref="p5189">Matthias Held</persName>, homuncio <foreign xml:lang="de">mit samet gekleidt <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>uswendig und inwendig, am halß ein guldine kettenen, die herab ist gangen <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>übergwerch von einer sitten</foreign> ad aliud latus; vagina ex serico, gladius auro <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>obductum, pileus, cingulus, calcei, caligae ex serico.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">D. <persName>Theobaldus Papa</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>d. <persName>Paulus</persName> medicus, homines procerę staturę sequuntur prępositum novum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dein reliqui sericati.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Episcopus adiunxit illi curiae magistrum, quo pompa <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>esset splendidior.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Petiit a senatu pręposituram illam, quam a papa adsecutus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sit et <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> iure obtinuerit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Noster vero prępositus dixit paucis se a <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>senatu nostro electum et confirmatum habereque eam sub iusto titulo in possessione <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quieta iam ad annos aliquot pręposituram; propterea nolle cum eo contendere <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>aut ullam conditionem suscipere senatui <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensi</placeName> id committens, quo eum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>defendat ab istis raptoribus beneficiorum ecclesiasticorum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Multa protrusit factit<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ius ille, nempe se velle quotidie 4 mens s ex alere, bona sua, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quę possideat, <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> absumere et, si quid negotii senatus coram Cę<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sare vel rege habeat, facile compositurum apud illos, apud quos magn<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>a i<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>n aestimatione sit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Respondit senatus communibus suffragiis se elegisse <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>prępositum, quem et servare velint contra omnes eamque potestatem habere.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">A... confir... etiam... Interim decretum de c<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>urtisanis adduxerunt.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Triste fuit responsum praeposito; sed devoratur mira astutia omne tędium.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vide, quid Satan moliatur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p5189">Heldt</persName> emit <placeName>Fri<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>burgi</placeName> aedes splendidas a nobile quodam, <foreign xml:lang="de">gibt im darumb 8000 fl. und ettlich <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>hundert.</foreign></s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Has pecunias a Protestantibus et episcopis decepticiis verbis <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>acquisivit; <persName>Selestadii</persName> <foreign xml:lang="de">het er angelegt 16000 fl.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> noster laborat podagra, bonus senex, et mirum, quum nullas <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>un<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>quam collegerit thesauros nec avaritię studuerit, ea molestia vexari.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Aiunt d. Rainaldum Polum <persName>Anglum</persName> in papam creatum novum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si Satanic<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>i eum non seduxerint, ecclesiae ob pietatem et eruditionem, quibus virtutibus pollet, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>prodesse poterit.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">3. ianuarii.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Precor tibi, uxori et omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tuis felix anni auspicium.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine meo d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> et reli<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quos.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Quan<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>do adsolves concionum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>tuarum Decades?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>praeceptori suo perpetuo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
